      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COSMIC ORDER (4) racing well in her first prep with the one win from five starts. Went back from the outside gate and never got into the contest when sixth over 1100m at Wyong a week-and-a-half ago. Can stalk the speed today and take holding out. THE WARRIOR (3) win record hardly excites but recent runs have been satisfactory. Comes back in trip after warming up late when fourth over 1350m at Wyong. Will relish the fast tempo and the claim helps again. Each way. AETERNUM (2) showed good early speed with the 62.5kg for a courageous on-pace fourth over 1006m at Port Macquarie. Will give a sight again on the backup. ARGYROS (1) returns from a lengthy break. Scored a dominant win on debut over 1007m at Taree, then nailed late with a close-up fourth over 1000m at Port Macquarie last October. Wasn't pushed out in the two trials and there blinkers go on.",
